# Only the compiled output directory is ignored. A bare `build/` also shadowed
# build/goreleaser.yaml, build/checksums.sh and build/install.sh, which are
# tracked release tooling — any tool that cleans ignored paths deleted them off
# disk while git still expected them.
build/dist/
build/out/
proofboard
proofboard.exe
dist/
keys/
.DS_Store
PR-DESCRIPTION.md

bundle.js
proofboard-cli.txt

# Compiled release binaries. These belong in GitHub Releases, which the release
# workflow already builds and attaches them to; two full copies were previously
# committed here. The bare `proofboard`/`proofboard.exe` names above did not
# cover the per-platform ones the build actually produces.
dist_original/
proofboard-darwin-*
proofboard-linux-*
proofboard-windows-*
*.sig

# Root-level session working notes. The .agents/ directory is deliberately
# tracked and kept.
handoff.md
progress.md
error-report.md
temp_changes.txt
